From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:13:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] modules: Let modules count the player's clicks

The click event (ADR 0052): each mouse press over the world, for CPS and Keystrokes.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/MouseHandler.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/MouseHandler.java
index 2fd7b4bb27d63fd16221421c8844086e022eb51f..70d5065ad0b0ddc3eb2af6ab991601a56f1be4c7 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/MouseHandler.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/MouseHandler.java
@@ -140,2 +140,5 @@
                 if (pressed) {
+                    // Incari start: modules count clicks (CPS)
+                    incari.client.modules.ModuleInput.click(rawButtonInfo.button());
+                    // Incari end
                     KeyMapping.click(mouseKey);
